  "bio": "Banner is a highly skilled illustrative tattoo artist based in Brighton, United Kingdom, who brings art to life on skin with expert precision. Operating at Blue Dragon Tattoo Brighton, Banner is known for their impeccable professionalism, ensuring each client's experience is comfortable, respectful, and tailored to their individual needs. To book an appointment from Thursday to Sunday, clients are encouraged to reach out via email, as Banner dedicates Tuesday and Wednesday exclusively for walk-ins.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Brighton, England, United Kingdom\n\n🕸️Bold or fine\n⚡️Flash or custom work \n🇬🇧 Plymouth & Portsmouth\n7 days a week\nEvening appointments available \nDm or email",
